@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
hide footbox
actor "Pengguna" as P0
participant "Komponen AI" as P1
participant "Express API" as P2
participant "Gemini" as P3
P0 -> P1: Kirim pertanyaan / analisis
P1 -> P2: POST konteks sesuai izin
P2 -> P2: Verifikasi token dan role
P2 -> P2: Terapkan batas permintaan
P2 -> P3: generateAiContent()
P3 --> P2: Hasil atau gangguan layanan
P2 --> P1: Respons hasil / kode error
P1 --> P0: Tampilkan hasil atau error
@enduml